<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Endless_Adventures_Packages">Endless Adventures Packages</span></h2>
<p>An Endless Adventures Package (or EAP) is a quest or dungeon. A modder designs their dungeon or quest area, uses a script template to provide a hook character in the "hub" area, and uses a predefined script to send the player back to the "hub" area once the quest or dungeon is complete.
