<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Special_Notes">Special Notes</span></h2>
<p>To begin (or continue) to hone your skills as a Dragon Age modder, try modding for the Community Contest at: <a rel="nofollow" class="external free" href="http://social.bioware.com/wiki/datoolset/index.php/Community_Contest_Main_Page">http://social.bioware.com/wiki/datoolset/index.php/Community_Contest_Main_Page</a>
</p><p>If you would like to create content that seamlessly integrates into the main DAO campign and setting, check out the Extended Community Canon Project at: <a rel="nofollow" class="external free" href="http://social.bioware.com/group/2171/">http://social.bioware.com/group/2171/</a>
</p>
